From: RCT Screensaver <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:43:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Title screen: plugin-driven fades of sound effects around
 view changes

TitleSequence.fadeSounds(level, ms) ramps the title screen's sound effects and positional ride music to level (0 to 1) over ms of real time, starting from the current level. The mixer applies it to the sound effects group on the title screen; ride music channels apply it on top of the park cross-fade, except a park's even soundtrack and circus music (a sound effect, faded by the mixer). Any scene change resets it. The screensaver plugin fades out ahead of each scheduled view change and fades in on each new view.
